      "title": "Qt: Use the GUI debounce filter on the CaptureFilterEdit",
      "message": "Qt: Use the GUI debounce filter on the CaptureFilterEdit\n\nCapture filters can have host name lookups. For certain hosts\nand systems (especially with single labels when LLMNR or similar\nis enabled) the timeout can be quite large. The CaptureFilterEdit\nonly processes one filter at a time, waiting for each response.\n\nThat means that if someone types a capture filter like\n\"host www.sonic.com\", pcap_compile will perform getaddrinfo\ncalls for \"w\" \"ww\" \"www\" and so on. Use the timer and only\ntry to compile the filter after a reasonable gap in text\nediting.\n\nFix #19692. Part of #20032\n",
